Subject: overlayfs-allow-casefolded-data

Android's casefolded f2fs data directories set dcache hash and compare flags.
Do not reject those directories solely for those flags when OverlayFS checks
its upper and work paths.

Source: android.googlesource.com/kernel/common commit bd23337e42e794964a89f47596daf1209a25ee1a

--- a/fs/overlayfs/util.c
+++ b/fs/overlayfs/util.c
@@ -201,9 +201,7 @@
 		return true;
 
 	return dentry->d_flags & (DCACHE_NEED_AUTOMOUNT |
-				  DCACHE_MANAGE_TRANSIT |
-				  DCACHE_OP_HASH |
-				  DCACHE_OP_COMPARE);
+				  DCACHE_MANAGE_TRANSIT);
 }
 
 enum ovl_path_type ovl_path_type(struct dentry *dentry)

